# The Demoman's Stickybomb Launcher (real TF2; ours: stickies.scene): one
# sticky, held 0.1 s, down 2fort's bridge onto its floor (the launch, the
# trail, the landing, the armed pulse), recorded at 30 frames a second for
# 1.6 s (`stk_NN`), then the detonation (attack2) at 60 (`det_NN`).
#   tools/tf2ref/tf2ref.py scene tools/tf2ref/scenes/stickies.tf2 --out <dir>
mp_disable_respawn_times 1
cl_drawhud 0
r_drawvgui 0
r_drawviewmodel 1
fov_desired 90
viewmodel_fov 54
fps_max 60
tf_weapon_criticals 0
host_framerate 0
bot_kick all
sleep 1
jointeam red
sleep 1
joinclass demoman
kill
sleep 7
use tf_weapon_pipebomblauncher
sleep 2
setpos 0 -300 0
setang 30 90 0
sleep 3
shot sticky_idle
host_framerate 0.033333
movie stk
wait 2
+attack
wait 6
-attack
wait 96
endmovie
host_framerate 0
sleep 2
shot sticky_armed
host_framerate 0.016667
movie det
wait 2
+attack2
wait 6
-attack2
wait 80
endmovie
host_framerate 0
